OL,3,GNEWSAOvernight clifftop camper-van
OL,4,Aparking could be banned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is restarting a consultation
OL,7,Fto regulate the overnight parking of
OL,8,Fcamper-vans alongside a clifftop road.
OL,10,FResidents have accused Bournemouth
OL,11,FPoole and Christchurch (BCP) Council of
OL,12,Finaction on the issue that impacts the
OL,13,Fpeople that live along Boscombe and
OL,14,FSouthbourne Overcliff.
OL,16,FThey said the camper-vans and
OL,17,Fmotorhomes are unregulated and have
OL,18,Faccused van dwellers of anti-social
OL,19,Fbehaviour, leaving litter and say they
OL,20,Fhave created a public health concern by
OL,21,Fdiscarding human waste.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
